          <name>TRCSEQEVR[%s]</name>
          <description>Description collection: Moves the sequencer state according to programmed events. Might ignore writes when the trace unit is enabled or not idle. When the sequencer is used, all sequencer state transitions must be programmed with a valid event.</description>
