              <field>
                <name>RATEDIV</name>
                <description>Decrease write rate of acqusition or read rate of injection Zero gives native rate of the selected ACQMODE/INJMODE. Every increment by 1 will halve the rate.</description>
                <lsb>16</lsb>
                <msb>17</msb>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>CYCLIC</name>
                <description>The END event of DMA automatically triggers the START event so that it continuously will store/read data</description>
